## What was implemented

1. `apps/api/src/domain/context-pack/coerce-evidence-policy.ts` -- server-side coercion of
   `QueryContext.evidencePolicy` against the SAME contract enum (`packages/contracts` `EvidencePolicy`),
   failing closed to `"primary-only"` (the strictest reading) on anything that does not parse --
   including a forged/tampered client value. Never trusts a raw string as the branded enum.
2. `apps/api/src/domain/context-pack/evidence-policy-filter.ts` -- the front-filter that excludes
   `sourceType === "ai-generated"` (== synthesized, by the DB's own
   `artifacts_ai_is_synthesized` invariant, migration 0006) candidates when the coerced policy is
   `"primary-only"`. Same placement (after disclosure, before fusion) as F93's consent prefilter,
   and for the identical reason.
3. `apps/api/src/application/retrieval/retrieve-candidates.ts` -- wired the above into the real
   five-channel retrieval pipeline: accepts `evidencePolicyRaw: unknown`, coerces it once, excludes
   synthesized candidates under `"primary-only"` (traced as an `out-of-scope` omission -- a
   statement about what evidence the query accepts, not about who is asking, so `unauthorized`
   would misdescribe it), and exposes what was actually enforced as `evidencePolicyEnforced` on
   the outcome.
4. `apps/api/src/domain/files/generated-visibility.ts` -- `strictestConfidential`: a `generated`
   artifact's effective `confidential` flag is the OR of what the caller asked for and every
   source it was assembled from (uc-22-3 R7 「架构第五节」/ R12 V7), so a summarizer cannot
   launder a confidential source into a looser result.
5. `apps/api/src/application/files/materialize-source.ts` -- `MaterializeSourceInput` gained
   optional `confidential`/`sourceConfidentialFlags`; for `sourceType === "generated"` the stored
   `confidential` is `strictestConfidential(...)`, never the caller's raw value alone. Every other
   sourceType is unaffected (only generated content can "launder" a source).

No changes to `packages/contracts` -- `synthesized` is derived from the existing
`sourceType === "ai-generated"` fact (already on `CandidateRow`/`ContextItem`), not a new field,
per the repo's "same fact, one place" discipline.
